  "title": "Waymo and California Ban Driverless Rides on Freeways",
  "summary": "Waymo suspended its driverless taxi rides on US freeways after California banned the vehicles following multiple incidents involving autonomous vehicles, citing potential safety risks. The ban applies to all freeways across the US, including California, and Waymo has stopped offering rides on freeways indefinitely.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Waymo suspended its driverless taxi rides on US freeways after California banned them following multiple incidents involving autonomous vehicles.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
